    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This stunning four-bedroom semi-detached end property comes to the market in showhouse condition, ideally positioned in a quiet, family-friendly setting adjacent to a large green area. Not overlooked to the front or rear, this home offers both privacy and space in one of Mullingar’s most sought-after residential locations. \r\n\r\nRecently fully repainted internally and externally, the property has been meticulously maintained and upgraded to a high specification throughout, offering bright, spacious and tastefully decorated accommodation ideal for modern family living. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room featuring a solid fuel stove, and a bright open-plan kitchen/dining area with direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms (master en-suite) and a fully fitted family bathroom. Newly carpeted stairs and landing add to the fresh, turnkey finish. \r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property boasts a large private south-facing garden, perfect for outdoor living and enjoying afternoon and evening sun. The garden is secure and benefits from made-to-measure wrought iron side gates, along with a garden shed for additional storage. To the front, there is ample off-street parking for two cars. The property benefits from a B3 BER Rating, making it highly attractive to buyers seeking energy efficiency and reduced running costs. \r\n\r\nA B3 rating can also qualify purchasers for green mortgage rates, offering potential savings on borrowing costs as well as lower energy bills due to improved insulation and modern heating efficiency. A standout feature of this property is the newly installed gas heating system. This includes a modern high-efficiency boiler, newly fitted radiators with individual thermostatic controls, and smart app-based functionality, allowing remote management of heating and hot water. This advanced system provides exceptional comfort, convenience, energy savings, and modern smart-home control, allowing homeowners to heat the house only when needed and arrive to a warm home. \r\n\r\nLocation: Belvedere Hills is a highly desirable development located just minutes from Mullingar town centre. The property is within walking distance of schools, shops, creches, and all local amenities, while also offering easy access to the N4/N52 for Dublin commuters. Mullingar train and bus stations are also nearby, making this an ideal location for families and  alike. Viewing is highly recommended to truly appreciate the quality, space, and excellent location this outstanding home has to offer.\r\n\r\nEarly contact through Egans is highly recommended."
      },
